  "title": "Nasdaq Reports Fourth Quarter and Full Year 2024 Results; A Year of Strong Financial Performance and Strategic Execution",
  "summary": "2024 net revenues 1 were $4.6 billion, or $4.7 billion on a non-GAAP basis 2, an increase of 19% over 2023, or up 9% on an adjusted 3 basis. Annualized SaaS revenues increased 14% and represented 37% of ARR. Financial Technology revenue of $438 million increased 10% over the fourth quarter of 2023, or up 7% on an adjusted basis. Index revenue of $188 million grew 29%,...",
